'''Assassin [[Canthan armor]]''' is an art type available in the Factions campaign as collector armor for the region of Kaineng City and as regular crafted armor. It is also available in the Eye of the North expansion.

The [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of this armor is [[Assassin Elite Canthan armor]].

